          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura ku vugavuli yivu, Musa yavugula muhambe mulala kutura ku vahambe amusini kandi mitugu kuli Yahova yalaga, nahaana ku vandu va Levi, avalindaa Lihema lia Yahova, kuli Yahova yaali nalagi Musa.",
          "type": "text",
